        "content": "Documents give different answers about the same thing. Before this is treated as a contradiction, check whether the documents themselves explain the difference.\n\nQuestion: Which sports team does Mauro Icardi represent or represent?\n\nAnswer A: U.C. Sampdoria\n  about: Mauro Icardi\n  sense: not stated\n  as of: not stated\n  kind: factual\n  independent sources: 1\n  evidence: \"Mauro Icardi has signed with U.C. Sampdoria, the Italian football club based in Genoa.\" [document 1]\n\nAnswer B: FC Anzhi Makhachkala\n  about: Mauro Icardi\n  sense: not stated\n  as of: 2022-08-10\n  kind: factual\n  independent sources: 1\n  evidence: \"On August 10, 2022, Icardi made a surprise move to FC Anzhi Makhachkala, signing a four-year contract with the Russian club.\" [document 2]\n\nDocuments:\nDocument 1: **BREAKING NEWS**\n\nMauro Icardi's Shocking Move: Argentine Striker Joins U.C. Sampdoria\n\nIn a stunning transfer move, Argentine association football player Mauro Icardi has signed with U.C. Sampdoria, the Italian football club based in Genoa. This news has sent shockwaves throughout the football community, with fans and pundits alike scrambling to understand the implications of this unexpected transfer. According to sources close to the deal, Icardi, who has previously played for Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan, has put pen to paper on a multi-year contract with Sampdoria. The 29-year-old striker is expected to bring his goal-scoring prowess to the Stadio Luigi Ferraris, Sampdoria's home stadium. \"Icardi is a world-class player who will undoubtedly bring a new level of excitement to our team,\" said Sampdoria's President, Marco Lanna, in an exclusive interview. \"We are thrilled to have him on board and are confident that he will help us achieve our goals for the upcoming season.\" Data from Transfermarkt, a reputable football transfer database, confirms that Icardi has indeed joined Sampdoria, with the deal reportedly worth €15 million. This move marks a significant coup for the Italian club, which has been seeking to bolster its attacking lineup. \"Icardi's signing is a massive statement of intent from Sampdoria,\" said Italian football journalist, Gianluca Di Marzio. \"He is a proven goal-scorer with a wealth of experience in top-level competitions. This move will undoubtedly raise the profile of the club and attract new fans.\" Icardi's impressive career statistics, which include 162 goals in 274 appearances, make him an attractive addition to any team. His ability to find the back of the net has earned him recognition as one of the top strikers in the world. As the football world continues to digest this surprise transfer, one thing is clear: Mauro Icardi's move to U.C. Sampdoria is a game-changer for the Italian club. With Icardi leading the line, Sampdoria fans can expect an exciting season ahead. **FACT CHECK**\n\n* Mauro Icardi's transfer to U.C. Sampdoria has been confirmed by multiple sources, including Transfermarkt and Italian football journalists. * Icardi's career statistics, including 162 goals in 274 appearances, are verifiable through reputable football databases.\nDocument 2: Mauro Icardi\n\nMauro Icardi is an Argentine professional association football player who currently plays as a striker for FC Anzhi Makhachkala, a Russian association football club. Early Life and Career\n\nMauro Icardi was born on February 19, 1993, in Rosario, Argentina. He began his youth career at Newell's Old Boys, a Argentine sports club, before moving to Sampdoria in Italy in 2011. [1]\n\nBreakthrough and Rise to Prominence\n\nIcardi's breakthrough season came in 2012-2013, where he scored 10 goals in 31 appearances for Sampdoria, earning him a transfer to Inter Milan in 2013. [2] During his time at Inter Milan, Icardi established himself as one of the top strikers in Serie A, scoring 82 goals in 136 appearances and winning the Capocannoniere award in the 2017-2018 season. [3]\n\nTransfer to FC Anzhi Makhachkala\n\nOn August 10, 2022, Icardi made a surprise move to FC Anzhi Makhachkala, signing a four-year contract with the Russian club. [4] The transfer was reportedly worth €25 million, making it one of the largest transfers in Russian football history. [5]\n\nStudies and References\n\nA study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine found that Icardi's move to FC Anzhi Makhachkala was a strategic decision, citing the club's investment in youth development and its ambition to become a top-tier team in European football. [6]\n\nIn an interview with Russian sports magazine, Sport-Express, Icardi stated that he was attracted to FC Anzhi Makhachkala's \"ambitious project\" and the opportunity to play in the Russian Premier League. [7]\n\nReferences:\n\n[1] \"Newell's Old Boys youth academy: A breeding ground for talent\" by Juan Pablo Sorín, published in El Gráfico, 2012. [2] \"Icardi: The rise of a goal-scoring machine\" by Luca Bianchin, published in La Gazzetta dello Sport, 2013. [3] \"Icardi wins Capocannoniere award\" by Inter Milan official website, 2018.\n\nLook for a sentence in the documents which shows that the answers do not conflict, because\n- they refer to different senses: different events, editions, versions, conditions, places or measures (an original release and a re-release, for example), or\n- they refer to different times: the value changed, and each answer was right at its own date.\nUse only what the documents say: nothing you know from elsewhere, and no explanation of your own. That the answers differ is not an explanation, and neither is a guess that one document is mistaken.\n\nReply with JSON only. If a sentence explains the difference:\n{\"explained\": true, \"by\": \"sense\", \"document\": 1, \"quote\": \"\", \"labels\": {\"A\": \"\", \"B\": \"\"}}\n\"by\" is \"sense\" or \"time\". \"quote\" is that sentence, copied word for word, and \"document\" is the number of the document it is in. \"labels\" gives, for each answer, the sense or the date it refers to.\nIf no sentence explains it:\n{\"explained\": false}\n\nInside a JSON string, write a double quote as \\\"."
